---
// Safe to edit by hand
// The board grammar's section break (PORTS.md card 188, from FBC Auburn's BoardRule).
// SectionRenderer draws one before every section on a site whose hero is `board`
// (brand.config.json layout.hero), in place of the alternating band colours. Whitespace only
// by default: the marker lives beside worded eyebrows (BoardLabel), so it marks something
// instead of punctuating every band. A brand that wants a visible rule sets --board-rule
// (a hairline, a short bar) in its brand layer; src/styles/board.css draws it.
import '@/styles/board.css';
---

<div class="board-rule-wrap" aria-hidden="true"></div>
